# Build-time API base for the deployed submission. NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are embedded in
# the client bundle, so this URL is public by construction — it is the same Cloud Run
# service anyone can already call, and it holds no secret.
#
# Note that `.env.local` (gitignored, and pointing at a developer's local API) takes
# priority over this file, so the deploy passes the value explicitly in the environment
# as well. See `firebase.json` and the deployment notes in the README.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SKUTRUTH_API_BASE_URL=https://skutruth-api-680305457743.us-central1.run.app
